{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56113","headline":"步虚词 六 · 杜光庭","name":"步虚词 六","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"头脑礼金阙，携手遨玉京。\n骞树圆景园，焕烂七宝林。\n天兽三百名，师子巨万寻。\n飞龙踯躅吟，神凤应节鸣。\n灵风扇奇华，清香散人襟。\n自无高仙才，焉能耽此心。\n（同前卷七。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杜光庭","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_56113.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56113","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}